


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_fa02f433:



    voice "2MI_1162"
    miyako "「呀！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_4ae3dbc7:


    "扬声器突然发出巨大的响声。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_4780e8cc:


    "足以震动整个房间的音量让圣夜子不由捂上了耳朵。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_7aa343c4:


    "最初撕裂空气般的刺耳哀嚎，随着音频降低慢慢收敛。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_95c31dc2:


    "最终，噪音也平息下来——"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_32c6a31a:



    voice "2NO_0006"
    noel "「圣诞快乐！」" (show_name="声音")


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_c92e7fd5:


    "化为人声。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_ba6f945a:



    voice "2MI_1163"
    miyako "「诶！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_776da7cf:


    "这迟到一个半月的圣诞祝福让圣夜子惊讶地抬起头。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_0fbe1c99:


    "在那里的是——"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_0225f5f3:



    voice "2NO_0007"
    noel "「不过没有圣诞树也没有蛋糕……话说好冷！」" (show_name="少女")


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_a7875eea:


    "圣夜子倒吸一口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_e014abaa:


    "在那里的是抱住肩膀、打着寒颤的自己。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_108fc54e:



    voice "2MI_1164"
    miyako "「这……是我？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_c7df3796:


    "幻象扫视四周，找到围巾后将其绕在了脖子上。那条围巾和圣夜子戴的是同一条。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_04251645:



    voice "2MI_1165"
    miyako "「那、那个、这到底是……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_fbf9bb9e:


    "圣夜子尝试搭话，但“她”完全没有看向她。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_b60c3d4e:



    voice "2NO_0008"
    noel "「校内抽一根还是不好吧？」" (show_name="圣夜子？")


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_5f361d03:



    voice "2MI_1166"
    miyako "「抽一根？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_27b0f1a2:


    "“她”没有对圣夜子的提问做出反应。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_699b9adf:



    voice "2MI_1167"
    miyako "「在自言自语？看不见我？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_0304ef81:



    voice "2NO_0009"
    noel "「嘛，算了。反正是最后一次了」" (show_name="圣夜子？")


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_e68a58db:


    "她熟练地从盒中取出一根香烟，叼在嘴里。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_78d9e859:



    voice "2NO_0010"
    noel "「感觉自己成了卖火柴的小女孩啊。不过我拿的是打火机。啊，那个故事是发生在跨年夜来着？」" (show_name="圣夜子？")


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_0684c07d:


    "白烟飘散开来。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_29dc8f59:



    voice "2MI_1168"
    miyako "「不对……这、不是我？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_6e9a66de:


    "圣夜子从没抽过烟。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_19f994e3:



    voice "2MI_1169"
    miyako "「那、那个……啊咧？啊咧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_4c55e931:


    "圣夜子战战兢兢地朝“她”的肩膀伸手，但手穿了过去。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_71e1e576:


    "她又试了一次，还是碰不到“她”。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_db179795:



    voice "2MI_1170"
    miyako "「诶……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_4bc2bfe3:


    "圣夜子还一头雾水的时候，幻象穿过了她的身体。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_b6d68697:


    "“她”嘴里点过火的香烟划过圣夜子的脸颊，但圣夜子没有任何感觉。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_3fc3b2ec:


    "幻象就这样走到窗边拉开窗帘，擦拭起结露的玻璃。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_2d9f5b40:



    voice "2NO_0011"
    noel "「噢噢，我就说怎么这么冷，20xx年的圣诞节是白色圣诞节啊～」" (show_name="少女")


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_3516bc8d:


    "幻象赞叹道，但现实中的窗帘一动也不动。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_c8e3f2f6:



    voice "2MI_1171"
    miyako "「20xx年？我现在看到的只是一段过去？那……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_c78d95d8:


    "圣夜子环视周围，寻找“触媒”。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_80436d87:



    voice "2MI_1172"
    miyako "「这一定是“触媒”引发的现象，而且还是相当强力的……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_a2bee496:


    "她最先注意的自然是无线通讯机。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_74adfdfe:


    "不是它。它只有无线通讯机的功能，充其量也就是能连通到“稍远的地方”。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_83fadd4a:



    voice "2MI_1173"
    miyako "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_84a02b22:


    "圣夜子环视房间一周后似乎有所察觉。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_05649814:



    voice "2MI_1174"
    miyako "「整个“广播室”都是“触媒”！」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_b2118eab:


    "——没错。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_22acb3ec:



    voice "2MI_1175"
    miyako "「这个幻象是乃绘瑠同学。她以这样的形式再次……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_6baf389e:


    "圣夜子有些怀念地看着幻象，倾听着“她”的声音。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_eb38e686:



    voice "2NO_0012"
    noel "「呼，真是有够拖沓的。可算是来了，而且是最后关头勉强赶上啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_43ff742d:


    "在圣夜子梳理现状的时候，幻象自言自语着。时而吐烟，时而叹息。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_5e9becc5:



    voice "2SA_1065"
    sachiko "「唔……嗯嗯」" (show_name="？？？")


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_f80b5fff:



    voice "2NO_0013"
    noel "「嗯？醒来了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_d11b5ee4:



    voice "2MI_1176"
    miyako "「诶，还有其他人在？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_3c6cc564:


    "听到声响，幻象转身拉上窗帘，然后拿起椅子上的毯子走了回来。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_318fe024:



    voice "2NO_0014"
    noel "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_5c81ea57:


    "幻象俯下身，看向桌子下方。圣夜子也蹲下身一起看去。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_de5e0f2f:



    voice "2MI_1177"
    miyako "「……没醒啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_3b19b863:


    "有个人裹着单薄的毛毯、手脚蜷缩地躺在里头。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_1bfe5864:



    voice "2NO_0015"
    noel "「怎么了，这不还是怕冷嘛。昨晚还说冷才好来着」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_fcee21bc:


    "“她”嘴上抱怨着，却还是给那个人添上了刚才拿来的毯子。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_412e88ab:



    voice "2NO_0016"
    noel "「你感冒了我可不管啊。又不是天使了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_45e15213:



    voice "2MI_1178"
    miyako "「是祥子！」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_2f7a5fd6:


    "圣夜子喊出了裹着毛巾的人的名字。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_7ae95ee5:


    "幻象抽出折叠椅，倒坐在上头。“她”把手肘抵在椅背上，端详着祥子的背影。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_d2bcffc1:



    voice "2NO_0017"
    noel "「胆小鬼」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_5d2689d5:



    voice "2MI_1179"
    miyako "「诶……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_2c991e1d:



    voice "2NO_0018"
    noel "「闹什么别扭嘛，还尽说一些冷言冷语」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_a236f8a4:



    voice "2NO_0019"
    noel "「骨子里明明粘人得很。只是害怕坦诚真心吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_393bd3f9:



    voice "2NO_0020"
    noel "「还说自己是天使，这种地方不是像极了人类嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_ba2ce461:


    "趁对方在睡觉就口无遮拦、想说就说啊。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_5506f828:



    voice "2MI_1180"
    miyako "「啊咧，这个感觉刚才……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_cdfbf6fc:


    "圣夜子发现了。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_d8d0fd7e:


    "是啊。每一句说给对方的无奈评论，都是表里不一的表达。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_1ff583a3:



    voice "2MI_1181"
    miyako "「这样啊……她们俩之间的气氛与我们俩截然不同……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_8b78bbc7:


    "圣夜子观摩着乃绘瑠与祥子的幻象，露出了柔和的笑容。但日历透过幻象映入她眼帘的一刻，她立刻晃过神来。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_8957cbc9:



    voice "2MI_1182"
    miyako "「等等，如果这天是圣诞节，那乃绘瑠同学她……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_59727733:



    voice "2NO_0021"
    noel "「呼……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_805ee295:


    "幻象略带疲惫地叹了口气。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_547a7e22:


    "“她”把烟灰抖进桌上的空罐里，注视着睡梦中翻了身的祥子的睡脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_ecf0c3fe:



    voice "2NO_0022"
    noel "「能理解为什么大家都痴迷于此了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_c13a82e7:


    "幻象不经意间流露出如痴如醉的表情，手指掠过自己的身体。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_6d449261:



    voice "2NO_0023"
    noel "「……感觉超级舒服啊。虽然差点死了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_be30b3f2:



    voice "2MI_1183"
    miyako "「啊……原来如此」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_362e0bea:


    "圣夜子也察觉到了昨晚这里发生的事情。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_0945bda7:



    voice "2NO_0024"
    noel "「但为了接触到你，我用光了所有的力气吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_c7d3539c:



    voice "2NO_0025"
    noel "「嘛，总之也算是体验了一把，所以我也没有留恋了。问题在于……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_2d7445c5:



    voice "2NO_0026"
    noel "「祥子你今后会承担很多不必要的烦恼吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_0584c3a8:



    voice "2MI_1184"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_59da476b:


    "完美预见了现在的状况。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_86eadd2a:



    voice "2NO_0027"
    noel "「……谢谢你的陪伴。这半年里，你就是我活下去的动力。没有夸张，都是实话」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_c8cc1c65:



    voice "2NO_0028"
    noel "「今后希望你能为了自己去享受在地上的生活、去享受人生。对，连同我的份一起」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_6b779bdb:



    voice "2NO_0029"
    noel "「爱情有着可观的容量。小小的脑袋很快就会被塞得满满当当。喜欢上别人的时候，过去的回忆就会被新的记忆覆盖」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_d4255f92:



    voice "2NO_0030"
    noel "「关于我的记忆，用新的恋情统统覆盖掉吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_b406c03f:



    voice "2NO_0031"
    noel "「这是我最后的愿望。管你是神也好，天使也好，还是任何人都好，请帮我实现愿望吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_3fc35fe3:



    voice "2NO_0032"
    noel "「愿将来某一天，她能再度爱上别人，并再度被人所爱……」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_a5f98f20:



    voice "2NO_0033"
    noel "「咳咳」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_ffc94f9b:


    "“她”突然剧烈地咳嗽起来。咳嗽的原因不是烟。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_0b4d3fcf:



    voice "2NO_0034"
    noel "「啊啊，我死后能不能成为天使啊。这样就能一直守望着这个人了」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_77757237:



    voice "2MI_1185"
    miyako "「……乃绘瑠同学」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_9170036b:



    voice "2SA_1066"
    sachiko "「嗯……唔唔？」" (show_name="声音")


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_909989e8:



    voice "2NO_0035"
    noel "「啊，抱歉，我吵醒你了？你在东张西望什么啊？这里是广播室。做梦了吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_5d885d4c:


    "幻象在此结束，“触媒”陷入了沉默。"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_182b3d1b:



    voice "2MI_1186"
    miyako "「……乃绘瑠同学，接受了一切」"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_6b107b50:


    "圣夜子抬起头。"




translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_22615cc7:


    voice "2NO_0008"


translate simplified_chinese a11_cou4_10_04481b8b:


    noel "「校内抽一根还是不好吧？」" (show_name="圣夜子？")
